<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;line-height:1.7;max-width:860px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 28px}
h1{font-size:22pt;color:#111827;border-bottom:3px solid #c5a028;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
h2{font-size:14pt;color:#111827;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:4px;border-left:4px solid #4fd1c5;padding-left:12px;background:#f4fdfc}
h3{font-size:12pt;color:#374151;margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:bold}
p{margin:4px 0 10px}
.meta{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:10pt}
.meta p{margin:3px 0}
.meta strong{color:#b7881c}
.sec{border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;margin:10px 0}
.card-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11.5pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 4px}
.card-sub{font-size:10pt;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 4px;font-style:italic}
.card-desc{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}
.step-num{font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold;color:#c5a028;min-width:40px;line-height:1}
.step-body .step-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 3px}
.step-body .step-desc{font-size:10.5pt;color:#374151;margin:0}
.faq{border-left:3px solid #4fd1c5;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.faq-q{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;margin:0 0 5px}
.faq-a{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.cta{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;margin-top:28px}
.cta h2{color:#4fd1c5;border:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 8px;background:transparent;font-size:15pt}
.cta p{color:#d1d5db;margin:4px 0}
.cta .btn{display:inline-block;background:#4fd1c5;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:5px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10pt}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:10.5pt}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}
td:first-child{color:#6b7280}
td:last-child{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;text-align:right}
ul{padding-left:18px}
ul li{padding:2px 0;color:#374151}
</style></head><body><h1>Loan Types</h1><div class="meta"><p><strong>Page Title:</strong> Loan Programs Portfolio | Madison, WI Mortgage Solutions | Rob Miller</p><p><strong>Meta Description:</strong> Explore our comprehensive range of home loan programs. Rob Miller provides expert strategy for FHA, VA, Conventional, Jumbo, USDA, WHEDA, and Non-Conventional portfolio solutions in Wisconsin.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Loan Programs List</h2><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Conventional Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Conforming mortgages backed by Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac. Starting at just 3% down for qualified buyers, with customizable loan terms and automatic PMI cancellation.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore Conventional →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">FHA Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Government-backed loans designed to help home buyers secure financing with as little as 3.5% down. Offering flexible credit requirements and stable interest rates.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore FHA Loans →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">VA Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Exclusive mortgage program for veterans, active military members, and eligible surviving spouses. Features 0% down payment, no private mortgage insurance (PMI), and competitive interest rates.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore VA Loans →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Jumbo Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Financing tailored for luxury and high-value properties exceeding conforming limits. Enjoy competitive fixed-rate or adjustable-rate terms up to $3M+.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore Jumbo Loans →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">USDA Rural Housing</p><p class="card-desc">Zero-down payment mortgage option supported by the Department of Agriculture. Designed for eligible properties located in rural and suburban communities.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore USDA Options →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">WHEDA Loans (Wisconsin)</p><p class="card-desc">Wisconsin Housing and Economic Development Authority programs offering below-market fixed interest rates and down payment assistance options for state residents.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore WHEDA Assistance →</em></p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Non-QM & Investor Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Specialty mortgage programs including bank statement qualification, DSCR investor loans, and asset depletion solutions for self-employed or non-traditional borrowers.</p><p class="card-sub"><em>Link: Explore Portfolio Loans →</em></p></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Education Blocks</h2><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Conforming Mortgages</p><p class="card-desc">Loans that conform to the guidelines and lending limits established by Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac ($832,750 conforming limit in 2026). They offer the lowest interest rates and standard documentation checklists.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Jumbo Mortgages</p><p class="card-desc">Mortgages that exceed the conforming limit, requiring specialized underwriting and slightly higher reserve requirements. Ideal for premium Dane County home acquisitions.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Specialty Non-QM Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Portfolio products that bypass standard W-2 tax documentation. Ideal for self-employed clients using bank statements, or investors using rental property cash flow (DSCR).</p></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Program Matrix</h2><div class="card"></div><div class="card"></div><div class="card"></div><div class="card"></div><div class="card"></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Hero Section</h2><h3>LOAN PROGRAMS PORTFOLIO.</h3><p>We offer a complete suite of standard residential, government-backed, and specialized portfolio home loans tailored to support your specific purchase or refinance goals.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Main Page Content</h2><h3>UNDERSTANDING YOUR OPTIONS.</h3><h3>WHICH LOAN IS RIGHT FOR YOU?</h3><h3>MEET OUR HOME LOAN PROGRAMS.</h3><p>Before selecting a program, it helps to understand the main categories of residential home financing.</p><p>We align your personal profile with the correct program to maximize rate discounts, grant funds, and credit flexibility. Review the profile guide on the right.</p><p>Select any program below to explore criteria, down payment requirements, and regional guidelines.</p></div></body></html>